{
  "slug": "b12-claude-plugin",
  "name": "B12",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "B12 plugin with two skills: Website Generator (create a B12 website from a brief description) and B12 Website Editor (edit a live B12 website using Claude's browser access in Claude Cowork).",
  "longDescription": "Ships **2 skills**, `b12-website-editor` (Edit and improve a live B12 website using Claude's browser access in Claude Cowork), `website-generator` (This skill allows you to create a professional, engaging, and user-friendly website in seconds using AI).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install b12-claude-plugin@knowledge-work-plugins` from `b12io/b12-claude-plugin`.",
